Run fastfetch to show system information beside Yurei's girl-and-ghost mascot.
The colored Unicode text artwork is sampled from the shared Plasma splash.
It works without an image-capable terminal or a Nerd Font.

System defaults: /etc/xdg/fastfetch/config.jsonc
Personal overrides: ~/.config/fastfetch/config.jsonc
Artwork: /usr/share/fastfetch/yurei-logo.txt
For a plain report: fastfetch --logo-type none
User configuration is never overwritten by the distribution defaults.

Artwork source: themes/plasma/yurei/contents/splash/images/wave-00.png
Maintainer regeneration: python3 branding/generate_fastfetch_logo.py (Pillow)
Original visual asset licensing: ARTWORK.md in the Yurei source.
